# Single Property Analysis Template

A comprehensive template for analyzing individual investment properties, tracking cash flow, returns, and tax implications.

## Sections

### Property Overview
- Property address, type, purchase details, financing information, LTV ratio

### Monthly Cash Flow Analysis
- Monthly income (rent, parking, laundry, other)
- Monthly expenses (mortgage, taxes, insurance, HOA, management, maintenance, repairs, utilities, vacancy, CapEx reserve)
- Net Operating Income (NOI), debt service, net cash flow, cash on cash return

### Annual Performance Metrics
- Gross rental income, operating income, NOI
- Cap rate, cash on cash return, total return
- Break-even ratio, debt coverage ratio
- Depreciation analysis (27.5-year schedule, tax shield)

### Tax Analysis
- Annual depreciation, mortgage interest, property taxes, operating expenses
- Total deductible expenses, taxable income
- Federal and state tax savings

